Custom cipher reference: src/grf_ciphers.rs, src/grf_protected.rs,
scripts/grf_des.py, and tests/fixtures/generate.py. ThreeWay's reference algorithm
follows the public-domain Crypto++ implementation. Changes here add Python
decoding, general-purpose protected encoding, container writing, and disk tools.

